| Programming B: Selection in quizzes | 1 Exploring conditions; 2 Selecting outcomes | Unit 4, session 1 | The quiz's condition and its outcomes, traced with the score in a trace-table; selection as review of grade 3 | None of 1 and 2 |
| Programming B: Selection in quizzes | 3 Asking questions; 6 Evaluating a quiz | Unit 4, sessions 2 and 5 | Lesson 3: two ways to ask and score a question, compared for correctness and clarity (session 2); lesson 6: evaluating a quiz, as the reader's check of comments and code (session 5), kept after the build as the publisher has it | None of 3 and 6 |
