session that first uses it (lesson 16), never as a readiness check or a reteach. No grade 4 row assumes a grade 2 or
earlier row directly. The last use of each row is grade 3 computer science, the year before; the grade 3 frame
(docs/courses/computer-science-grade-3/frame.md, written beside this one) names its unit and days, and the scope gate's
count governs the treatment. Each grade 3 row below names the grade 4 row in its hands_on in
data/progressions/computer-science.csv.

